# If you add any omit's here, update tools/deploy's 'npm prune' call to match, because the
# prune --omit options *replace* the .npmrc omit options set.
#
# Skip optionals to omit firebase-admin's Firestore and Storage deps, which we don't use.
# They pull in about 100 packages that are half the dep tree, and (as of 10/2026) include
# the deprecated glob@10.5.x package, producing a deprecation warning at deploy time.
# If you end up needing some optional dep packages, pull them in by adding them to package.json.
omit=optional
